{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/953","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/953/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/953/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/953/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/953","id":352741875,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzNTI3NDE4NzU=","number":953,"title":"Allow for spaces between delimited docblock values?","user":{"login":"aripringle","id":1278449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzg0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1278449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aripringle","html_url":"https://github.com/aripringle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aripringle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aripringle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aripringle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aripringle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aripringle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aripringle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aripringle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aripringle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aripringle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":486061586,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0ODYwNjE1ODY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ee0701","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2018-08-21T23:02:53Z","updated_at":"2018-08-23T02:53:49Z","closed_at":"2018-08-23T02:53:49Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I've run across a third-party lib that has a docblock defined like this:\r\n\r\n```\r\n@return \\stdClass | null\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen running psalm against our codebase, where we check the result of this method for a null return value, psalm complains. It seems to only see the first value type:\r\n\r\n> ERROR: DocblockTypeContradiction - 10:5 - Cannot resolve types for $ret - docblock-defined type stdClass does not contain null\r\n\r\nI tested removing the spaces (`@return \\stdClass|null`) and everything worked as expected.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if this is considered valid syntax or not, but I noticed that other docblock parsers I'm using (PHPStorm, and I believe phpstan) seem to be accepting of it, so I thought I would bring it up in case it's a syntax that should be supported by psalm as well.\r\n\r\nHere's sample code (https://getpsalm.org/r/cd63a0ae57):\r\n\r\n```\r\n<?php\r\n\r\n/** @return string | null */\r\nfunction foo(string $s = null) {\r\n    return $s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n$ret = foo();\r\n\r\nif ($ret === null) {\r\n\techo 'null value';\r\n}\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/953/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/953/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}